{"3032620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knight of Justice", "steam_appid": 3032620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4015040], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Style:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a  blend of <strong>tower defense strategy</strong> and <strong>solo exploration</strong> with a mix of magic and close combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons are pushing humanity to the brink! Fight for survival alongside new friends, get stronger, gather resources, and recruit allies to enhance your power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/c655a06f121f4dfdea6476e595858a49.poster.avif?t=1775252581\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/c655a06f121f4dfdea6476e595858a49.webm?t=1775252581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/c655a06f121f4dfdea6476e595858a49.mp4?t=1775252581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Stories:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the world’s secrets, help your allies, and reclaim what was lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Suki and friends as they grow, forge bonds, and overcome challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/46199bf232d2889a994efe21809bb957.poster.avif?t=1775252581\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/46199bf232d2889a994efe21809bb957.webm?t=1775252581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/46199bf232d2889a994efe21809bb957.mp4?t=1775252581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Ways to Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique challenges—some battles call for teamwork and strategic defense, while others demand you take on foes alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new combat skills and recruit unique units. Can you rally everyone to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/1eb147952e9d71d322b47f3d1e2dc85f.poster.avif?t=1775252581\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/1eb147952e9d71d322b47f3d1e2dc85f.webm?t=1775252581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/extras/1eb147952e9d71d322b47f3d1e2dc85f.mp4?t=1775252581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suki never saw herself as a hero. A shy, struggling girl from the modern world, she used video games to escape her troubles—until one night, the impossible happened. A glowing portal burst open from her screen and pulled her into a war-torn fantasy realm, where magic is real and danger is everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, lost in a world on the brink of destruction, Suki finds herself among the last survivors of humanity. Under the protection of the formidable Knight of War, Reina, these refugees cling to hope in a small, battered camp while ruthless demons continue their relentless assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Suki can't hide here. Not anymore. If she wants to survive—and protect her newfound friends—she must confront her fears, discover hidden strengths, and become the hero this world desperately needs: a Knight of Justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Suki rise to the challenge and embrace her destiny, or will darkness consume the last hope of humanity? The journey begins now.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suki never saw herself as a hero. A shy, struggling girl from the modern world, she used video games to escape her troubles—until one night, the impossible happened. A glowing portal burst open from her screen and pulled her into a war-torn fantasy realm, where magic is real and danger is everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, lost in a world on the brink of destruction, Suki finds herself among the last survivors of humanity. Under the protection of the formidable Knight of War, Reina, these refugees cling to hope in a small, battered camp while ruthless demons continue their relentless assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Suki can't hide here. Not anymore. If she wants to survive—and protect her newfound friends—she must confront her fears, discover hidden strengths, and become the hero this world desperately needs: a Knight of Justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Suki rise to the challenge and embrace her destiny, or will darkness consume the last hope of humanity? The journey begins now.</p>", "short_description": "A fantasy action game featuring real-time combat, party building, exploration, and strategic tower defense as you rise from outsider to hero in a world besieged by demons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032620/b7b8a27768b4f10a4f178b3cfe1dfedebe1930dd/header.jpg?t=1775252581", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai